OL,3,GNEWSAReview set into scrapped car park 
OL,4,Adevelopment plans                      
OL,6,FThe leader of Huntingdonshire District 
OL,7,FCouncil has confirmed there will be an 
OL,8,Findependent review into abandoned plans
OL,9,Fto build homes on town centre car park 
OL,10,Fsites.                                 
OL,12,FProposals were formally dropped at a   
OL,13,Fcouncil meeting this week, after 90% of
OL,14,Fresidents in a survey said they did not
OL,15,Fwant it.                               
OL,17,FThe council commissioned developer     
OL,18,FCapital and Centric to come up with    
OL,19,Fregeneration plans. More than #1m was  
OL,20,Fspent on developing proposals and      
OL,21,Fconsulting with local residents.       
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
